{"id":"2f92d2057834d0ce","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-one-generic-set.md","title":"1-Generic Set","display":"df-one-generic-set — 1-Generic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-one-generic-set","aliases":["68-df-one-generic-set"],"display":"df-one-generic-set — 1-Generic Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-tree]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-sequence-code]]"],"source_location":"not located in supplied PDF; local meet-or-avoid definition","verification_status":"local-formal-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-one-generic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-one-generic-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-one-generic-set — 1-Generic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e933c06a0edd826\" href=\"?note=7e933c06a0edd826\" title=\"68-df-recursive-tree\">68-df-recursive-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied PDF; local meet-or-avoid definition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-formal-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_G\">\\(\\chi_G\\)</span>、有限二进制串集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\)</span> 及前缀关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7e933c06a0edd826\" href=\"?note=7e933c06a0edd826\" title=\"68-df-recursive-tree\">68-df-recursive-tree</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sc}\">\\(\\operatorname{sc}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a>。自然数编码中不属于有限二进制串的元素在下式中不参与测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{1\\text{-}Generic}(G)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{sc}(\\chi_G\\upharpoonright n)\\in W_e)\n\\ \\lor\\ \n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\n\\bigl((\\chi_G\\upharpoonright n)\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{sc}(\\tau)\\notin W_e\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{1\\text{-}Generic}(G)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl[\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{sc}(\\chi_G\\upharpoonright n)\\in W_e)\n\\ \\lor\\ \n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;\n\\bigl((\\chi_G\\upharpoonright n)\\sqsubseteq\\tau\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{sc}(\\tau)\\notin W_e\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Cohen 二进制串的 meet-or-avoid 定义。每个 W_e 给出一个可枚举的字符串集 {σ∈B:sc(σ)∈W_e}；不是把数值枚举集 W_e 本身与字符串集作类型不兼容的包含比较。</p>\n<p>在所给 Shoenfield PDF 全文与目录中未定位到 generic 条目，因此只记录本地形式定义，不标为原书定义。本定义不会自动给出泛型集合的存在性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-tree","status":"resolved","id":"7e933c06a0edd826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-tree","status":"resolved","id":"7e933c06a0edd826","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_G$、有限二进制串集 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$ 及前缀关系见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]。$W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。自然数编码中不属于有限二进制串的元素在下式中不参与测试。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_G$、有限二进制串集 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$ 及前缀关系见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]。$W_e\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。自然数编码中不属于有限二进制串的元素在下式中不参与测试。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":